# Tech Stack Standards

## Required Stack
- **Next.js** (latest)
- **Tailwind CSS** (latest stable)
- **Auth.js** for authentication
- **Resend** for email (if needed)
- **Stripe** for payments (server-side only, use Connect for payouts)
- **Convex** for data, file storage, real-time sync
- **Google Sign-In** as initial auth provider

## Package Manager
- Always use **bun**

## Authentication
- Follow guides in `~/Documents/auth0-guide`
